@0    = ~Well, well... If it isn't the Bhaalspawn I saw in Athkatla! I had a feeling our paths would cross again. I was traveling south on business and stopped in Saradush for the night, right before those damn giants besieged the city. Now I find myself trapped here with everyone else, while my associates in Calimshan are wondering where their promised deliveries have gone.~
@1    = ~Convincing the local guards to let me leave the city requires a substantial amount of gold, and my purse is not a Bag of Holding. Fortunately, I brought some of the most valuable relics from my collection with me. Normally, I would only part with these artifacts for a small fortune, but given the... unusual circumstances, I am willing to offer you a considerable discount. Would you like to see my wares?~
@2    = ~Let's see what you have.~
@3    = ~No, thank you.~
